 "paragraphs": [
  {
   "html": "</path></svg></a></div><div class=\"flex justify-center Header_buttonContainer__rN6i5\"><button class=\"pointer-events-auto Header_button__qn2Wj Button_main__NewW7 Button_default__CcbQU\"><span class=\"Button_inner__d7ZPg\">Menu</span></button></div><div class=\"hidden w-[130px] justify-end md:flex\"><a class=\"pointer-events-auto\" aria-label=\"About\" href=\"/about\"></a></div></div></div><main style=\"--theme-primary:16 16 16;--theme-secondary:255 255 255;--theme-tertiary:255 255 255\" class=\"bg-black\"><div style=\"opacity:1\"><div class=\"relative z-main bg-theme-primary transition-bg duration-theme\"><sectio",
   "text": "MenuCyberBrokersFuturistic GUI for a post-apocalyptic metaverseVisit SiteCyberBrokers are building a free-wheeling, vivid and exceptionally entertaining new world of NFT collectibles. All co-owned and created alongside their fans."
  },
  {
   "html": "200 years from now, beneath our frozen earth, the last of humanity plug their minds into a virtual playground where anything goes. Welcome to The Paradigm Lost… home of the CyberBrokers!",
   "text": "200 years from now, beneath our frozen earth, the last of humanity plug their minds into a virtual playground where anything goes. Welcome to The Paradigm Lost… home of the CyberBrokers!"
  },
  {
   "html": "</path></svg></span></span></a></div></h4></div><div class=\"col-span-full space-y-1.5 md:col-span-4\"><h3 class=\"t-p font-semibold\">Category</h3><h4>Brand + Website</h4></div><div class=\"col-span-full space-y-1.5 md:col-span-4\"><h3 class=\"t-p font-semibold\">Date</h3><h4>2022 - ∞</h4></div></div></div></div></div></section><section data-theme=\"light\" class=\"text-theme-secondary transition-colors duration-theme\"><div class=\"WrokBloks_main__IqYqU\"><div class=\"ui-grid mx-auto my-sgs max-w-site gap-y-sgs\"><div class=\"relative col-span-full aspect-[1680/970]\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 h-full w-ful",
   "text": "CategoryBrand + WebsiteDate2022 - ∞An expanding universeThe CyberBrokers team needed a website that can keep pace with the future of entertainment and community they are creating. It had to be an intuitive on-boarding for new fans while letting dedicated fans go deeper and deeper."
  },
  {
   "html": "We created a site that&#x27;s more than a place to store stories… it&#x27;s a part of those stories.",
   "text": "We created a site that&#x27;s more than a place to store stories… it&#x27;s a part of those stories."
  },
  {
   "html": "We explored multiple creative territories with CyberBrokers&#x27; founder, digital artist Josie Bellini before settling on &quot;The Pinboard&quot;. This infinite canvas Homepage is designed to float visitors inside this metaverse, surrounded by incredible characters and relics.",
   "text": "We explored multiple creative territories with CyberBrokers&#x27; founder, digital artist Josie Bellini before settling on &quot;The Pinboard&quot;. This infinite canvas Homepage is designed to float visitors inside this metaverse, surrounded by incredible characters and relics."
  },
  {
   "html": "Users can examine 3D objects, turn them over, and then dive deeper into their stories - exploring 10,001 character profiles, AI-generated locations, or data chips containing the latest tales from the &#x27;Brokers&#x27; lore.",
   "text": "Users can examine 3D objects, turn them over, and then dive deeper into their stories - exploring 10,001 character profiles, AI-generated locations, or data chips containing the latest tales from the &#x27;Brokers&#x27; lore."
  },
  {
   "html": "The CyberBrokers NFT collection is super-colourful, so we established a darker feeling for the site to  let the colours burst. We created a colour-theming system that responds to the content on each page and displays a complementary palette for its UI elements.",
   "text": "The CyberBrokers NFT collection is super-colourful, so we established a darker feeling for the site to  let the colours burst. We created a colour-theming system that responds to the content on each page and displays a complementary palette for its UI elements."
  },
  {
   "html": "Our UI design was inspired by futuristic OS with influences like GMUNK, Fallout and Snow Crash. The interfaces are retro-future holographic but intentionally glitchy - as if they&#x27;ve been patched together for two centuries!",
   "text": "Our UI design was inspired by futuristic OS with influences like GMUNK, Fallout and Snow Crash. The interfaces are retro-future holographic but intentionally glitchy - as if they&#x27;ve been patched together for two centuries!"
  },
  {
   "html": "The stickers on the Homepage were created by our team to feel like cyberpunk graffiti and featuring moments from the lore. We designed the Location pages as “Live Feeds” from the future, as scanning them with high-tech binoculars while breaking news hits the HUD.",
   "text": "The stickers on the Homepage were created by our team to feel like cyberpunk graffiti and featuring moments from the lore. We designed the Location pages as “Live Feeds” from the future, as scanning them with high-tech binoculars while breaking news hits the HUD."
  },
  {
   "html": "We wanted a sense of exploration to run deeply through the site. Each CyberBroker character can have its on-chain SVG layers (aka clothes), turned  on and off to uncover hidden qualities.",
   "text": "We wanted a sense of exploration to run deeply through the site. Each CyberBroker character can have its on-chain SVG layers (aka clothes), turned  on and off to uncover hidden qualities."
  },
  {
   "html": "Users are co-creators in this world rather than just consumers. You can purchase and assemble giant robot NFTs for your characters then port them into different 3D applications to tell your own stories.",
   "text": "Users are co-creators in this world rather than just consumers. You can purchase and assemble giant robot NFTs for your characters then port them into different 3D applications to tell your own stories."
  },
  {
   "html": "The CyberBrokers website is built to grow, and has already expanded with a network of sites including <a href=\"https://pretty.cyberbrokers.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Pretty&#x27;s Loot Store</a>, and the <a href=\"https://snap.cyberbrokers.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Snap Shak Mech Garage</a>.",
   "text": "The CyberBrokers website is built to grow, and has already expanded with a network of sites including Pretty&#x27;s Loot Store, and the Snap Shak Mech Garage."
  },
  {
   "html": "Built on <a href=\"https://www.storyblok.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Storyblok</a> the site has an deeply flexible system allowing CyberBrokers&#x27; team to keep it constantly updated as their universe expands. And custom interfaces allow them to add new relics to the Homepage or 3D locations pages.",
   "text": "Built on Storyblok the site has an deeply flexible system allowing CyberBrokers&#x27; team to keep it constantly updated as their universe expands. And custom interfaces allow them to add new relics to the Homepage or 3D locations pages."
  },
  {
